    nw_fail: ['That son of a bitch {a} is in hospital because he can\'t control himself: he picked a fight with {b}.', '{b} taught {a} a lesson. Nobody saw a thing.', '{a} tried to act hard with {b} and now eats soup through a straw.', '{a} picked on {b} and left on a stretcher. Bad choice.', 'That idiot {a} attacked {b}. It went so badly it’s almost sad.', '{b} didn’t even get up from his chair and {a} was already on the floor.'],
    nw_sick: ['That pig {a} went to the hookers and came back with itchy balls.', '{a} caught something at the hookers. The hospital says thanks.', 'That filthy bastard {a} went to the hookers and grew a mushroom on his dick.', '{a} went to the hookers and brought back something the doctor has never seen.', '{a} can’t sit straight anymore. Hookers, obviously.', 'That pig {a} caught something at the hookers. Now he pisses razor blades.', '{a} left the hookers scratching all over. The hospital knows him by name.'],
